<h2>Recommended recipe</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Brew</th><th>Dose</th><th>Yield</th><th>Time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Filter</td><td>13g, grind 700</td><td>30g bloom, 90 seconds / 192g total</td><td>1:40 to 2:00</td></tr><tr><td>Espresso</td><td>18g</td><td>45g</td><td>23 seconds</td></tr><tr><td>Milk</td><td>22g</td><td>36g (150ml milk)</td><td>25 seconds</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>This is the MTSPACE reference recipe for natural coffees. Start with these numbers and adjust the grind as you taste. To see every layer of aroma and sweetness, we recommend filter.</p>
