<h2>FAQ</h2>
<p><strong>Q. Does honey processing mean honey is added?</strong><br />No. It is the name of a process that removes the fruit and dries the coffee with its sticky mucilage left on. More sweetness and texture remain than in a washed coffee.</p>
<p><strong>Q. What is the Cup of Excellence?</strong><br />A competition held in each producing country that judges and ranks that year's coffees. Santa Rosa has taken first place several times with Pacamara Honey.</p>
